nment.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1965 Jul 29 08:45 probe_l9_flipped_c2_shaft.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  2110 Jul 29 08:44 probe_l9_flipped_c5_yellow_cross.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  2384 Jul 29 08:43 probe_l9_flipped_c5_supports.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  2112 Jul 29 08:41 probe_l9_between_barrier_flips.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1565 Jul 29 08:33 probe_l9_early_gap_alignment.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff   973 Jul 29 08:32 probe_l9_unflipped_barrier_gap.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1040 Jul 29 08:31 probe_l9_supported_unflipped_gap.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1033 Jul 29 08:30 probe_l9_return_right.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1685 Jul 29 08:27 probe_l9_timed_prefix_deletions.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1183 Jul 29 08:26 probe_l9_return_vertical_lanes.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff   906 Jul 29 08:25 probe_l9_supported_return_goal.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1264 Jul 29 08:24 probe_l9_c9_staged_climb.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff   982 Jul 29 08:23 probe_l9_c9_undo.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1481 Jul 29 08:23 probe_l9_supported_c9_actions.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff  1296 Jul 29 08:22 probe_l9_supported_gap_right.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff   731 Jul 29 08:21 probe_l9_supported_gap_walk.py\n-rw-r--r--  1 sasha  staff   926 Jul 29 08:20 probe_l9_supported_gap_climb.py\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The entry experiment confirms the raw mechanics: actions `3/4` move the six-pixel avatar left/right, `6,x,y` is contextual interaction, and `7` is inert at pristine entry. The direct trapdoor route reproducibly exposes the prize chamber but leaves a solid wall and zero controls, so its core suffix is falsified. I’m now testing the nearby support-staging variants from the same pristine boosted state; the dense progress signal is: retain a visible gravity control while decreasing the wall depth to the visible prize."}}
