{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_269","type":"agent_message","text":"The c5 lattice gives six safe rises and then reaches a true solid ceiling, so vertical progress is exhausted there. I’m branching only at that verified frontier: propagate an overhead stopper during each lateral handoff, once toward the right edge and once toward the left-side yellow opening, to identify which side goes around the wall."}}
